  "notes": "<p>The mini-symposium (co-chaired by Stefano Letizia and Julia Gottschall) was held on 25 June 2025, and comprised the following individual presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\"Sensitivity of the turbulence measurements from ground-based lidars to the beam orientation\" by Abdul H. Syed (a)</li>\n<li>\"A Comprehensive Sensitivity Analysis of Wind Lidar Uncertainty Using a Fiber Optic Bench and Monte Carlo Simulation\" ny Andrew Black (b)</li>\n<li>\"LARGE-EDDY-SIMULATION-BASED PERFORMANCE EVALUATION OF FLOATING LIDARS - MOTION CORRECTION &amp; WIND PROPERTIES RECONSTRUCTION\" by Benjamin Bouvier (c)</li>\n<li>\"Wind Field Reconstruction Using Single Doppler Lidar: A Lagrangian Approach\" by Ignace Ransquin (d)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please note that each document or presentation may have its own license. If in doubt about reusing or citing any of the material presented here, please contact the authors.</p>",
